+# Plain HTTP for internal hosts
+
+The project's current recorded decision is "HTTPS everywhere, no exceptions": plain HTTP is not permitted for internal hosts, which are held to the same HTTPS requirement as every other host. This is consistent with the separately recorded decision to keep verification enabled on all builds.
